{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0253_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6fb141fe9a0789573726c2fdf32c694b476efde1ad65305b7b19586e25ea7070", "ja": "（亜美達が京都で行ったイベントのライブは大盛況。\nこの調子で、地元の人達に広がれば……）", "zh": "（亚美她们在京都举办的活动，现场演出大获成功。如果能照这个势头，在当地人之间传播开来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0253_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "bbbf366c6ce1d51f4eaf4fa26a3a954b5b141e887a3b4057f4677ad8da2f30be", "ja": "じー……。\n兄ちゃん、やっと会えたね。", "zh": "盯——……\n哥哥，终于见到你了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0253_1002_p", "source_sha256": "38b330f65f6e0588b1076da7e5561cdca7bddb6d82642ff9a404eab5730009c0", "ja": "うわっ、亜美！？\nいつからそこにいたんだ？", "zh": "哇，亚美！？\n你什么时候在那儿的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0253_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "0d6792d3b50e330e057b290fa80fdceea7f6d1b3f4b3594122320f8426c92bd0", "ja": "いつからだと思う？　亜美は気配を消して\n近づくのも、追いかけるのもよゆーだよっ☆", "zh": "你觉得是从什么时候开始的？亜美消除气息，悄悄靠近或追上你都轻轻松松☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0253_1004_p", "source_sha256": "16fd6d5b6215dafdc217bd9f6abec6f6902ed1482a79bc66dd9cd23864677712", "ja": "時間的に……今、ちょうどレッスンの休憩中だな。\n来たのは、ついさっきか？", "zh": "从时间上来看……现在正好是课间休息。你是刚刚才来的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0253_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "de8a9904e299706ae87f2353f23a92c9f6ee43e21ff91d3671ea83cfcc26010c", "ja": "うあうあー！　兄ちゃんには\nアソビゴコロってものがないのかー！", "zh": "呜哇呜哇——！哥哥就没有一点玩心吗——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0253_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "157b1696fbc399071325ba711074162b095a907a37d6c354cebd13ea569bee02", "ja": "仕方がない……\nこうなったら最期は、亜美の手で……！", "zh": "没办法了……\n既然这样，最后就由亚美亲手……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0253_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "2ceb3675d9e64cb9eb0c03420f0ff3745363e60c44a547711bba93341ef0c970", "ja": "亜美のせいじゃないよ！\n全部全部、兄ちゃんが悪いんだからー！", "zh": "不是亚美的错哦！\n全都是全都是哥哥的错啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0253_1008_p", "source_sha256": "38e4ab36d29bfa271990436a540377ab1e7f2de74b8ca487e5fb7a475185b3af", "ja": "急に不穏だな。というか……もしかして、\nわざとヤンデレっぽくしてないか？", "zh": "突然变得不对劲了啊。话说……你该不会是\n故意在装病娇吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0253_1009_011ami", "source_sha256": "41de0183c7d07ddf4010dba065f3d7d2f1b0483cc617c28f245d796b91514928", "ja": "やっと気づいたね、兄ちゃん君！\nどう？　亜美のカンペキなヤンデレっぷり！", "zh": "你终于发现了，哥哥！\n怎么样？亜美这完美的病娇表现！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0253_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "6586b29fb5bc9bb8d93ab7eaf7653b4bdff13a42e0d1771773c5e806f8c3e3ce", "ja": "新曲のPV撮った時、「こういう亜美……\nけっこうよくない！？」って思ったんだよね～！", "zh": "拍新歌PV的时候，我就觉得：“这样的亚美……是不是还挺不错的！？”～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0253_1011_p", "source_sha256": "511f2656b743ed80d9f493bba0ed8f2d8146f0bc06f49eec00785bfad0a89e28", "ja": "うん、なかなか良かったと思う。\n良かったから、そろそろレッスンに……。", "zh": "嗯，我也觉得挺不错的。\n既然觉得不错，那差不多该去练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0253_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "a153a32e506536d606ee80390da81c2ab3d9da3c0fb3d29d6bdaa4dcec494ab3", "ja": "よしっ！　亜美、これから毎日、\n兄ちゃんにヤンデレ攻撃しかけるかんねっ！", "zh": "好！亚美从今天开始，每天都要对哥哥发动病娇攻击！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0253_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "825b95684e0ac7c97254fd2c8b9a8789e60385bba42d702decbd391edd65b41b", "ja": "兄ちゃんが、亜美のコトが気になって気になって\nしょうがないようにしてやるー！　カクゴしろーっ！", "zh": "我要让哥哥满脑子都是亜美，时时刻刻都在想着亜美——！做好觉悟吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0253_1014_p", "source_sha256": "481956d4fd6aff8ae423a9bdd629ce6c9091dd8b3a47aab01b42c713b5fe9e2c", "ja": "聞いてないな。亜美、俺は外に出てくるから、\nレッスンにちゃんと戻るんだぞ。", "zh": "没在听啊。亚美，我要出去一下，你要好好回去上课哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0253_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "7c9b88f3fcac446bd40c4347cd698b4f37af6e3ac08c46d8b38936ed71d8e4c0", "ja": "は～い！　あ、そうだ、兄ちゃん！", "zh": "好——啊，对了，哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0253_1016_011ami", "source_sha256": "de43b413740678a65b63782ed6368b9950352b72fe0998f21d0b872c3529d02c", "ja": "兄ちゃんがどこにいても、亜美のココロは、\nずーっと一緒だかんね？　ばいきゅー！", "zh": "不管哥哥在哪里，亚美的心，都会一直和你在一起哦？拜拜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0253_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0253_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4b16999489477a53386b7417898def91452aeff9f25115cfb0dc7c3b2d68952b", "ja": "（亜美のやつ……バッチリだな。仕事中、\nちょっと背中を気にしてしまいそうだ……）", "zh": "（亚美那家伙……真够厉害的。工作的时候，我可能会有点在意身后了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
